            "review_title": "Review at Le Thanh Ton Sakaba",
            "review_text": "Nong\n23 contributions\n1\nTrue Japanese Food\nNov 2022\nI have been to Sakaba many times and the food and service are always excellent. The owners are really friendly and always welcome you a smile and a friendly greeding. I never liked curry rice and my girl friend would order it often and one day she told me I should try it, I had a taste and my feelings for curry rice changed. It was the best and I order it often when I go there. Yakitori is my favorite food, and their yakitori is on par with what I have in Japan.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten November 7, 2022",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-05",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
