            "review_title": "Review at Le Thanh Ton Sakaba",
            "review_text": "Bao D\n1 contribution\n1\nExcellent Japanese Food\nMar 2022\nI spent a lot of time in Japan, so I know a lot about Japanese food, and Sakaba does it right. Yakitori is my favorite Japanese food and every time I return to Vietnam I head to Sakaba for Yakitori. Cooked over charcoal and cooked perfectly. The owners are really nice people as is their staff. My favorite place to go for Japanese food in Saigon.\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten March 18, 2022",
            "rating": 5.0,
