            "review_title": "Review at Le Thanh Ton Sakaba",
            "review_text": "Joe B\n1 contribution\n2\nExcellent\nNov 2020\nFood is very tasty and the staff are very friendly. The owners are really very nice and always greet you with a friendly welcome. I have about 15 years in Japan and when I first went to Sakaba in Saigon and have my first stick of yakitori I felt I was enjoying it in Japan. I have never been a fan of curry rice but I decided to give their katsu curry a try and I became a big fan of it since. If you want to enjoy some excellent Japanese food, Sakaba is the place to go.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten May 6, 2021",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-05",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
