            "review_title": "Review at Le Thanh Ton Sakaba",
            "review_text": "Jung112\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam118 contributions\n0\nYakitori & Hot pot\nApr 2018 • Friends\nWhat a little hidden gem!! Everyone orders yakitori but they also have ushinabe (sukiyaki-like) beef hot pot with onions and tofu. After you eat the beef, you can order udon noodles to finish off the hot pot. Be sure to dip the cooked beef in the raw egg “sauce”. It’s simply delicious. Just a great izakaya with quick bites and rustic beef hot pot. It’s a must try in Saigon.\nRead more\nWritten June 6, 2018",
