            "review_title": "Review at Le Thanh Ton Sakaba",
            "review_text": "Gojoban\nHilo, Hawaii149 contributions\n1\nAs Good As Being In Japan\nMay 2014 • Couples\nI returned to Vietnam after six months back in the US, and Sakaba was the first place I wanted to eat. Yakitori is one of my favorite meals, and when in Japan I go to Izakaya every night. Seems I have been doing in Vietnam too :) and Sakaba is the place I go for great Japanese food. I am in Vietnam to enjoy Vietnam and Vietnamese food, but when I need my yakitori, I head to Sakaba as I know it will be great.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten May 11, 2014",
