            "review_text": "Gojoban\nHilo, Hawaii149 contributions\n2\n100 Percent Izakaya\nOct 2013\nAs soon as I walked into Sakaba I felt I was walking into an Izakaya in Japan. The yakitori is grilled over charcoal which gives it the taste of Japan. There are many good places to eat Japanese food here and this is one of the best. Prices are good and the food is excellent. Staff is very friendly and service is fast. Great place to enjoy Japan in Vietnam.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten October 6, 2013",
